# Crayon Bold

Playful, high-contrast sticker look for the kid pages only: warm paper background, white blocks with a 2px black outline, hard offset shadows, rounded corners, and flat colors. No gradients, no blurred shadows, no glass.

This rule applies only while editing the learn home, the learn-mobile session, KcTutor, and KcCourseProgress. Do not restyle admin, parent, creator, or any other page.

## Tokens

Add these as new names. Do not overwrite `--ink`, `--line`, `--shadow`, or any existing token. Do not change `body` for the whole app. Do not add Tailwind. Load Lexend and the paper background only inside a wrapper class used on the kid pages.

```css
.crayon {
  --cb-bg: #fffdf7;
  --cb-surface: #ffffff;
  --cb-ink: #111111;
  --cb-muted: #4a4a4a;
  --cb-line: #111111;
  --cb-track: #efefef;
  --cb-blue: #3b5bfd;
  --cb-yellow: #ffd43b;
  --cb-pink: #ff7ab6;
  --cb-green: #22c55e;
  --cb-sky: #7dd3fc;
  --cb-tutor-bubble: #ffe8f3;
  --cb-r: 14px;
  --cb-r-sm: 10px;
  --cb-bw: 2px;
  --cb-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--cb-line);
  --cb-shadow-sm: 2px 2px 0 var(--cb-line);
  --cb-shadow-lg: 6px 6px 0 var(--cb-line);
  font-family: Lexend, system-ui, sans-serif;
  background: var(--cb-bg);
  color: var(--cb-ink);
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}
```

## Rules

- Every block, card, button, input, chip, avatar, and progress bar inside `.crayon` has a 2px solid `var(--cb-ink)` border.
- Shadows are hard offsets only: `--cb-shadow`, `--cb-shadow-sm`, `--cb-shadow-lg`. No blur and no translucent shadows.
- Blue is the action color. Green is success. Yellow is highlight. Pink and sky are supporting accents. At most three accents in one block.
- Text is `--cb-ink` or `--cb-muted`, except white text on `--cb-blue`. Never put white text on yellow, green, sky, or pink.
- Lexend only, weights 400, 600, and 800. Body stays at least 15px.
- Pills for tags, nav, chips, and progress. `--cb-r-sm` for buttons and inputs. `--cb-r` for cards.
- No emoji as icons. A 2px ink border and a hard shadow on every new surface. No hardcoded hex in components.
- Visible focus ring: `outline: 3px solid var(--cb-blue); outline-offset: 2px`.
- Do not invent controls. Restyle only elements that already exist. Keep every link, query param, and handler.

## Prompts

Run one at a time. Stop and check the page before the next prompt.

Prompt 1. Add the Crayon Bold colors as the `--cb-*` names above. Do not overwrite `--ink`, `--line`, or `--shadow`. Do not change `body` for the whole app. Do not add Tailwind. Load Lexend and the paper background only inside a `.crayon` wrapper used on the kid pages. Build Block, Card, Button, Tag, FilterChip, SegmentedControl, ProgressBar, StackedBar, ProgressRing, Avatar, SectionTitle, EmptyState, Input, and TopBar for that wrapper. Do not change data fetching or routes.

Prompt 2. Restyle `/learn/[studentId]` with that wrapper. Keep the existing data and links. Restyle only elements that already exist. Do not add streak, minutes, a new nav, or any control the page does not already have.

Prompt 3. Restyle `KcTutor` on `/learn/[studentId]/course/[courseId]` and the learn-mobile session. Keep every handler, API call, and the `session`, `kc`, and `model` query params. Do not add Learn / Practice / Quiz, hint chips, or any control the page does not already have.

Prompt 4. Restyle `/kc-progress` and `KcCourseProgress`. Keep the student and course query params, the existing progress data, and the knowledge network. Do not add mastery pips or stacked-bar statuses the data does not already have.

Prompt 5. Check those pages only. Every new surface has a 2px ink border and a hard shadow, no hardcoded hex, no white text on yellow, green, sky, or pink, focus rings are visible, and the layout works at 375px, 768px, and 1440px. Do not restyle admin, parent, or creator.
